    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/fa82888636aa52522947c1fb3584d1c4.poster.avif?t=1737667778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/fa82888636aa52522947c1fb3584d1c4.webm?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/fa82888636aa52522947c1fb3584d1c4.mp4?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Save the Pirate! is an adventure game about a funny pirate, containing logical tasks. The main character must escape the dungeon, return his ship, and save his beloved. Take part in dangerous adventures with the Hero and determine his fate, but be careful \u2013 one wrong choice and you become a shark bait!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/20c0f73eee129aef78cd284e1bd00fe2.poster.avif?t=1737667778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/20c0f73eee129aef78cd284e1bd00fe2.webm?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/20c0f73eee129aef78cd284e1bd00fe2.mp4?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The game's storyline contains bonus levels and different options for the walkthrough with references to popular games and movies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/f5603dc39054efcac6ff015fcbd6ef0b.poster.avif?t=1737667778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/f5603dc39054efcac6ff015fcbd6ef0b.webm?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442240/extras/f5603dc39054efcac6ff015fcbd6ef0b.mp4?t=1737667778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The fate of the characters in each chapter and mega final will depend on the player's decisions during the game.",
